  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Dangerous_dmitri.jpg\" title=\"Dangerous Dmitri\"><img alt=\"Dangerous Dmitri\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"262\" src=\"/images/Dangerous_dmitri.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Dangerous_dmitri.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Dangerous Dmitri</div></div></div>\n<p>Dangerous Dmitri is an <a href=\"/wiki/Phantom\" title=\"Phantom\">Ebon Phantasm</a> Hero who will be found in a wrestling ring located somewhere in <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Purpose Pondering Peak</a> off Level 7 of <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Mutant Mania</a>.  He is the object of the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Ponderous,_Truly_Ponderous\" title=\"Ponderous, Truly Ponderous\">Ponderous, Truly Ponderous</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
